 f1164  | numeric(16,4) |           |          |         | main    | 
 f1n    | numeric       |           |          |         | main    | 
 f2     | numeric       |           |          |         | main    | 
 f2164  | numeric(16,4) |           |          |         | main    | 
 f2n    | numeric       |           |          |         | main    | 
View definition:
 SELECT f1,
    f1::numeric(16,4) AS f1164,
    f1::numeric AS f1n,
    f2,
    f2::numeric(16,4) AS f2164,
    f2 AS f2n
   FROM numeric_tbl;

